<title>USA: Washington Mutual Capital I sets $400 mln cap secs.</title>
<headline>Washington Mutual Capital I sets $400 mln cap secs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue of subordinated capital securities from Washington Mutual Capital I was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Lehman Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>The trust was formed by Washington Mutual Inc. The company will use the proceeds for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>BORROWER WASHINGTON MUTUAL CAPITAL I</p>
<p>AMT $400 MLN	 COUPON 8.375 PCT  MATURITY 6/1/2027</p>
<p>TYPE SUB CAP SEC   ISS PRICE 99.816  FIRST PAY DATE 12/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 8.392 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-PLUS   SPREAD +144 BPS   CALLABLE NON-CALL TEN</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
